{"seq":2,"slug":"promise-clock-exception-events","title":"承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/promise-clock-exception-events","wordCount":2385,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制\">承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>下单那一刻写下的 <code>estimated_delivery_date</code> 只是一张快照；真正决定「什么时候算超时」的，是一只在订单生命周期里持续推进的<strong>承诺时钟</strong>。它的当前值必须能在任意时刻被重放求出，而不是靠不断覆盖数据库字段来实现——否则当买家投诉「我下单时看到的日期是 5 月 3 日」时，没有任何证据能复原那一刻的承诺。</p>\n<p>时钟有两个权威源（authority），归属必须显式，不能互相顶替：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权威源</th>\n<th>谁写入</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>变化触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺计算服务（promise engine）</td>\n<td>平台 / 卖家侧</td>\n<td>生成初始承诺与顺延后的承诺</td>\n<td>出库、例外事件到达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商承诺（carrier commit）</td>\n<td>承运商</td>\n<td>时效件的 commit time（如 10:30）</td>\n<td>承运商公布服务中断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这两套时钟绝不能混用。买家看到的是平台承诺， sellers 被考核的也多是平台承诺（例如 Amazon 的 OTDR），而承运商索赔依据的是它自己的 commit time 与 Service Guarantee 条款。工程上要把它们<strong>分开存储、可交叉查询</strong>：同一订单同时持有 <code>promise_clock</code> 与 <code>carrier_clock</code> 两条时间轴，任何一次顺延都要标明它作用在哪一条上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时钟的状态机\">时钟的状态机</h2><p>承诺时钟不是被「修改」，而是在一组明确的状态之间迁移。每一次迁移都产生一条不可变的事件记录，而非覆盖旧值——这是后续一切审计与争议应答的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;PROVISIONAL&lt;br/&gt;下单时的预估承诺&lt;br/&gt;可被替换&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;出库后锁定的承诺&lt;br/&gt;成为判定基准&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;例外事件到达?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|承运商服务中断公告| D[&quot;SUSPENDED&lt;br/&gt;时钟停表&lt;br/&gt;保留在分母&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|清关放行| E[&quot;RESUMED&lt;br/&gt;重新起算剩余时长&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|买家原因&lt;br/&gt;地址不可达/未取件| F[&quot;EXCLUDED&lt;br/&gt;移出分母&lt;br/&gt;不判超时&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt;|无例外| G[&quot;ELAPSED&lt;br/&gt;到期,进入超时判定&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;VOID&lt;br/&gt;判定终止&lt;br/&gt;不进 OTDR 分母&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"PROVISIONAL&lt;br/&gt;下单时的预估承诺&lt;br/&gt;可被替换\"] --&gt; B[\"CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;出库后锁定的承诺&lt;br/&gt;成为判定基准\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"例外事件到达?\"}\n    C --&gt;|承运商服务中断公告| D[\"SUSPENDED&lt;br/&gt;时钟停表&lt;br/&gt;保留在分母\"]\n    C --&gt;|清关放行| E[\"RESUMED&lt;br/&gt;重新起算剩余时长\"]\n    C --&gt;|买家原因&lt;br/&gt;地址不可达/未取件| F[\"EXCLUDED&lt;br/&gt;移出分母&lt;br/&gt;不判超时\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; B\n    C --&gt;|无例外| G[\"ELAPSED&lt;br/&gt;到期,进入超时判定\"]\n    B --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H[\"VOID&lt;br/&gt;判定终止&lt;br/&gt;不进 OTDR 分母\"]</pre><p>关键在于 <code>SUSPENDED</code> 与 <code>EXCLUDED</code> 是两种<strong>不同的处理</strong>。**停表（suspend）**是时钟暂停、恢复后继续走，订单仍留在准时率分母里；**排除（exclude）**是把订单整体移出分母，不再参与任何准时率统计。把两者混为一谈，是准时率口径争议最常见的根源——承运商原因造成的延误若被整体排除，卖家准时率会被虚高；买家原因若只做停表，又会把本不可回收的延误算进分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"例外事件的分类矩阵\">例外事件的分类矩阵</h2><p>顺延不是「任何延误都免责」。判定引擎必须先给事件分类，分类结果决定它能否触碰承诺时钟，以及用哪种动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>例外类别</th>\n<th>触发源</th>\n<th>时钟动作</th>\n<th>证据要求</th>\n<th>可否索赔</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承运商服务中断</td>\n<td>承运商正式公告（极端天气、罢工、枢纽拥堵）</td>\n<td>停表，按公告起止时段顺延</td>\n<td>承运商服务警报页面 / 公告编号</td>\n<td>依该承运商 Service Guarantee 条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关卡滞</td>\n<td>海关查验、缺单证、缴税未响应</td>\n<td>停表，自清关放行重新起算运输时长</td>\n<td>海关状态事件 + 放行时间戳</td>\n<td>一般不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家原因</td>\n<td>地址不可达、无人签收、拒收、未取件</td>\n<td>排除，移出准时率分母</td>\n<td>派送尝试记录 + 通知留痕</td>\n<td>不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家原因</td>\n<td>迟发、错发地址、包装不合规</td>\n<td>不顺延</td>\n<td>出库时间晚于订单处理截止</td>\n<td>不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商作业原因</td>\n<td>分拣错发、丢件、扫描缺失</td>\n<td>排除 + 发起索赔</td>\n<td>轨迹断点分析</td>\n<td>可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可抗力</td>\n<td>监管限制、口岸封控</td>\n<td>停表或排除，以平台当期政策为准</td>\n<td>官方公告与生效日期</td>\n<td>依条款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>法规给免责线划的是<strong>下限</strong>而非上限。欧盟《消费者权利指令》Directive 2011/83/EU 第 18 条要求：除非另有约定，经营者应在合同订立后 <strong>30 天内</strong>交付商品；逾期未交付时，消费者可再指定一个合理期限，仍未交付即可解除合同，经营者须在 14 天内退款（eur-lex.europa.eu）；该条经 Directive (EU) 2019/2161 修订后强化了交付时限的信息披露义务。美国方面，FTC 规则 16 CFR Part 435 规定未明示发货时限时须在 <strong>30 天内</strong>发货，无法按期则须通知消费者并提供退款或延期（ftc.gov）。含义是：<strong>再完善的例外顺延，也不能把承诺无限推后</strong>——例外只调整超时判定的归责，不解除交付义务本身。</p>\n<p>平台考核口径则是另一条独立约束。Amazon 于 2024 年把「Arrives by」承诺升级为基于机器学习的<strong>送达日期范围（delivery date range）</strong>，其 OTDR（准点送达率）门槛为 90%、配套 Valid Tracking Rate ≥ 95%（sellercentral.amazon.com）；eBay Guaranteed Delivery 与 Shopify Shop Promise 各自定义了展示与考核口径（各平台官方文档）。这些数字是平台单方面设定的，且随年度政策调整，落地时必须以当期官方页面为准，不能把过期阈值写进代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"顺延算法-停表与重算\">顺延算法：停表与重算</h2><p>把「顺延」落实成算法，核心是选择<strong>停表式</strong>还是<strong>重算式</strong>。设某例外事件的持续区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_s, t_e]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（起止均为承运商当地公告时刻，须先归一为 UTC），承诺时钟的顺延量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ext</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{ext}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ext</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取该区间与订单剩余运输窗口的重叠部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ext</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>window_start</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{ext}} = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\min(t_e,\\, t_{\\text{deadline}}) - \\max(t_s,\\, t_{\\text{window\\_start}})\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ext</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.217em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">window_start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>顺延后的新截止为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ext</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{deadline}}&#x27; = t_{\\text{deadline}} + \\Delta_{\\text{ext}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.035em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ext</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个「取重叠」的设计避免了一个常见错误：把整个中断区间无差别加给每一单，会让已经出库、只差最后一公里的订单凭空多出一周承诺，虚高的顺延量最终由卖家在准时率上买单。</p>\n<p>两种实现路径的取舍可以固化为口径配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>停表式（suspend）</th>\n<th>重算式（recompute）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>改动对象</td>\n<td>只把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ext</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{ext}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ext</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加到截止时刻</td>\n<td>重跑承诺计算服务，产出全新截止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>高，可逐年逐案复现</td>\n<td>中，依赖运输时长表版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据依赖</td>\n<td>只需例外事件区间</td>\n<td>需当前运输时长表 + 目的地日历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>中断区间明确、时长短</td>\n<td>长期中断、整条线路失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对多数跨境场景，<strong>主用停表式、重大中断叠加重算式</strong>：先用停表给出可审计的顺延，再对整条线路失效触发重算。两种结果都要落库并标注口径版本，否则重算前后同一订单会出现两个不同截止而无从解释。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;例外事件到达&lt;br/&gt;含区间 t_s..t_e&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;事件类别&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|承运商中断| C[&quot;取与订单运输窗的重叠&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|买家原因| D[&quot;标记 EXCLUDED&lt;br/&gt;移出分母&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|清关| E[&quot;停表至放行时刻&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;t_deadline&#39; = t_deadline + Δ_ext&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;写入新承诺版本&lt;br/&gt;保留旧版本&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;判定终止&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;重跑超时判定&lt;br/&gt;产出新 verdict&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"例外事件到达&lt;br/&gt;含区间 t_s..t_e\"] --&gt; B{\"事件类别\"}\n    B --&gt;|承运商中断| C[\"取与订单运输窗的重叠\"]\n    B --&gt;|买家原因| D[\"标记 EXCLUDED&lt;br/&gt;移出分母\"]\n    B --&gt;|清关| E[\"停表至放行时刻\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"t_deadline' = t_deadline + Δ_ext\"]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"写入新承诺版本&lt;br/&gt;保留旧版本\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"判定终止\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"重跑超时判定&lt;br/&gt;产出新 verdict\"]</pre><h2 id=\"重复顺延与顺延疲劳\">重复顺延与顺延疲劳</h2><p>顺延机制越完善，越容易被滥用，也越容易叠加。两个缺陷模式必须在设计时就防住。</p>\n<p><strong>重复顺延（double-counting）</strong>：一次中断可能同时出现在承运商公告、平台公告、卖家自述三处，若三处都触发停表，顺延量就被算三遍。工程上给例外事件一个<strong>去重键</strong>（承运商 + 中断类型 + 起止区间的哈希），并规定「同一区间只顺延一次，取最长者」。去重键是顺延表的唯一约束，而非应用层的尽力而为。</p>\n<p><strong>顺延疲劳（extension fatigue）</strong>：某条线路连续数月频繁顺延，买家感知到的承诺持续后移，转化率随之下降。这不是判定引擎的问题，而是承诺生成的问题——应把该线路的<strong>例外频率</strong>回灌给承诺计算模型，让它在源头给出更保守的初始承诺，而不是在判定阶段永远兜底。这条反馈回路在第四章的履约度量里展开。</p>\n<p><strong>顺延必须可审计</strong>：每条顺延记录要落 <code>exception_id</code>、<code>source</code>（公告 URL 或事件 ID）、<code>interval</code>、<code>Δ_ext</code>、<code>authority</code>（平台 / 承运商）、<code>effective_at</code> 与所依据的规则版本。买家争议应答（例如 Visa 争议条件 13.1「商品或服务未收到」的证据包）需要能逐条说明「为什么这单被判准时」；如果顺延来源不可核验，证据包就站不住。这与判定管道「事件不可变、判定可重算、输出幂等」的原则是同一条要求在两处的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承诺不是一次写入的日期，而是持续推进的<strong>时钟</strong>；平台承诺与承运商 commit 是两条时间轴，必须分开存储、可交叉查询。</li>\n<li>时钟在 <code>PROVISIONAL → CONFIRMED → {SUSPENDED / EXCLUDED / ELAPSED}</code> 之间迁移，每次迁移产出一条不可变事件，绝不用覆盖字段实现。</li>\n<li><strong>停表（suspend）与排除（exclude）是两种动作</strong>：前者保留在分母，后者移出分母；混用会同时污染准时率的分子与分母。</li>\n<li>例外事件先分类再动作：承运商中断、清关、买家原因、卖家原因、承运商作业各有不同的时钟动作与证据要求。</li>\n<li>顺延量取例外区间与订单剩余运输窗的<strong>重叠</strong>，避免无差别全量顺延；主用停表式、重大中断叠加重算式，两种结果都标注口径版本。</li>\n<li>法规（EU 2011/83/EU 第 18 条、FTC 16 CFR Part 435）的 30 天规则给免责线划了下限，但例外只调整归责，不解除交付义务；平台口径（如 OTDR 90%）随年度政策变动，须以当期官方页面为准。</li>\n<li>去重键防重复顺延，例外频率回灌承诺模型防顺延疲劳，每条顺延可审计以支撑争议应答。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章的上下游：妥投事件本身如何定义、如何归一为可比较的时间戳，见<a href=\"delivery-event-and-lateness-basis\">同章第一节</a>；承诺时钟的<strong>初始值</strong>从哪里来、如何在下单时算出，见<a href=\"../delivery-promise-product/promise-date-computation-model\">第一章承诺计算模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制","id":"承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时钟的状态机","id":"时钟的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"例外事件的分类矩阵","id":"例外事件的分类矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"顺延算法：停表与重算","id":"顺延算法-停表与重算"},{"level":2,"text":"重复顺延与顺延疲劳","id":"重复顺延与顺延疲劳"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"妥投事件与超时判定口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/delivery-event-and-lateness-basis"},"next":{"title":"超时争议复核与判定申诉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/lateness-review-and-appeal"}}